(D) "Manufacturer" means either of the following:

(1) Any entity or the entity's successor that, in any location, manufactures or otherwise produces cigarettes, or causes cigarettes to be manufactured or produced, that the entity intends to be sold in this state, including, but not limited to, cigarettes intended to be sold in the United States through an importer;

(2) Any entity or the entity's successor that meets both of the following criteria:

(a) Purchases cigarettes, in any location, from a second entity that manufactures or otherwise produces cigarettes in any location when that second entity does not intend that the cigarettes it manufactures be sold in the United States;

(b) Intends to resell the cigarettes described in division (D)(2)(a) of this section in the United States.

(I) "Wholesale dealer" means either of the following persons:

(1) A person, other than a manufacturer, who sells cigarettes to retail dealers or other persons for purposes of resale;

(2) A person who owns, operates, or maintains one or more cigarette vending machines upon premises owned or occupied by any other person.
